'use strict';
// The Bloom Gardens long ago: the words (DESIGN.md 20 "T3a", game/TIME.md "The Bloom Gardens (T3a)"). Every line in es / pt / de,
// zh and ja in CJK.md's notation, and the English the weave mixes from ({w.gd_*}: this world's words, met as they're said).
// gardens_past.js is the valley of then, gardens_past_dungeon.js the new greenhouse inside, gardens_time_boss.js the Faded Bloom;
// time_gardens.js (GARDT) says, demonstrates and grades them.
// The grammar rung (TIME.md §8, rung 4): the imperfect for descriptions, «era», «había», «estaba lleno de…», «tenía». People describe
// how it was (demonstrations); you describe it back («Elio era muy callado», «Aquí había una fuente», «El cuarto estaba lleno de
// mariposas»). What happened once is the preterite, a B («fue»: "that's once"); the present misses ("that's now"). pt: the
// imperfeito («era», «havia» / «tinha», «estava cheio de»); de: the Präteritum of sein and haben, «es gab», «war voller» (the
// Perfekt is an A); zh: 以前 / 那时候 + 是 / 有 / 满是 (no 了; without a time word, an A: "say when"); ja: ～でした / ～がありました /
// ～でいっぱいでした (the present is a miss).
// The cast (each language its own): the old head gardener, young Melisa (today's head beekeeper), her mother the beekeeper, the
// glazier who built the greenhouse, a painter, young Tomasa and young Polo (today's judges).
